### 공통: 토큰 발급 후 사용
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### AgentGroup 목록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/configuration/agent-groups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "tenantDbid": 101
}

### AgentGroup 단건 조회
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/configuration/agent-groups/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "dbid": 10,
  "tenantDbid": 101
}

### AgentGroup 삭제
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/configuration/agent-groups/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "groupDbid": 10,
  "tenantDbid": 101
}

### AgentLogin 조회
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/configuration/agent-logins/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "loginCode": "1001",
  "tenantDbid": 1,
  "switchDbid": 1
}

